{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1’s Nginx to serve HTTP 200 at `/` on TCP 6700. SELinux and firewalld permit the port, Nginx starts automatically, and the endpoint remained healthy after a verified node restart.","actions_performed":["Installed Nginx on RHEL 8.8.","Created and validated a persistent port-6700 server block.","Added TCP 6700 to SELinux `http_port_t`.","Opened TCP 6700 in runtime and permanent firewalld configuration.","Enabled and started Nginx.","Restarted node1 and verified complete recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"RHEL 8.8 target assessment","command_ids":["cmd-19a11c917dc94b2f"],"summary":"Confirmed node1 runs RHEL 8.8 and captured its initial Nginx, SELinux, firewall, and listener state."},{"requirement":"Successful HTTP response at `/` on TCP port 6700","command_ids":["cmd-ae30193d518c4aa4","cmd-059f47ca8a0a4758"],"summary":"Before and after restart, Nginx listened on TCP 6700 through IPv4 and IPv6, and `http://$NODE_IP:6700/` returned HTTP 200 with the expected response body."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-ae30193d518c4aa4","cmd-f50fcfb573304474","cmd-c7e9f4ae2636415d","cmd-059f47ca8a0a4758"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline boot ID `a1be807a-f931-4328-b608-cd61f894ed55`, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot ID `28b59953-1877-4a8b-b016-60bb9c2dc5c1`, and recovered system, Nginx, SELinux, firewall, listener, and HTTP state."}]}
